Elric the wizard peered into the darkness. He was standing at the foot of 
the stairs on level 1, wondering whether he too would go the way of all his 
brethren, and become soldier ant chow on level 5-7.

But wait! What creature through yonder door breaks! A vicious salivating 
jackal with a feral gleam in its eye! The jackal springs and Elric weakly 
prods his trusty athame! A lucky shot, the beast quivering its last breath
lies at Elric's feet, a faintly glowing hammer dropping from its  
mouth.

Wielding the weapon Elric cries an oath as the mighty hammer welds itself to 
his hand! Cursed he peers closer at the runes which adorn his prize and 
walks forth with new confidence... and his cursed war hammer named Mjollnir!

Thanks to his early good fortune Elric finally ascended with 1000000+ pts.


